CORVA PACK | TRADE UPDATE | OCTOBER 2026

Hello Harbor Lane Provisions,

1. PPWR: what changes for takeaway cups
The EU Packaging and Packaging =
Waste Regulation applies from August 2026, and the first recyclability =
rules for cups and lids follow in 2030. All Corva double wall cups are =
already made from single-polymer board. Our sales team can send you the =
declarations of conformity per SKU.

2. New: plastic-free sip lids
From November our 80 mm and 90 mm sip lids are also available in moulded =
fibre. Same fit, slightly higher price. Samples on request.

3. Price notice for 2027
Board and PET prices are up again this year. List =
prices for cups and lids will rise by 3 to 5% from 1 January 2027. Orders =
placed before 15 December are invoiced at current prices.

4. Christmas and New Year
Our warehouse is closed from 24 December to 1 =
January. Last deliveries before Christmas leave on 22 December.

